'''Iron Mace''' is the third one-handed [[Clubs|club]] and the last pure [[Damage#Blunt|blunt]] club until the [[Ashlands]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The slower secondary attack deals 2.5x damage and 2x staggering.

